%H A060206 Andrew Howroyd, <a href="/A060206/a060206.pdf">Illustration of a(1) and a(2)</a>.
%F A060206 a(n) = A000682(2n + 1). - _Andrew Howroyd_, Nov 24 2015
%F A060206 a(n) = 4*A077460(2n + 1) - A005315(2n + 1) - A005316(2n + 1) for n > 0. - _Hunter Hogan_, Aug 08 2026
